<title>NORWAY: Aker RGI Q1 net profits jump.</title>
<headline>Aker RGI Q1 net profits jump.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>				    (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover				 6,062    vs     4,547</p>
<p> Operating result			 158    vs	 271</p>
<p> Result after financial items	 374    vs	 166</p>
<p> Net result				 210    vs	  53</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Norwegian industrial holding company is Aker RGI ASA. The company was established last year after investment company Resource Group International (RGI) merged with engineering and construction group AKER ASA. Comparative 1996 figures were calculated on a pro forma basis.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
